OL,3,GNEWSAPause of councils change leaves
OL,4,Abill of 'millions'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to abolish all of the councils in
OL,7,FDevon and set up four new unitary
OL,8,Fauthorities have been "paused", with an
OL,9,Festimated cost of several millions of
OL,10,Fpounds.
OL,12,FIn a surprise announcement, the
OL,13,Fgovernment said it was launching a
OL,14,Freview of plans across the country to
OL,15,Flook again at what would have been the
OL,16,Fbiggest reorganisation of local
OL,17,Fgovernment for 50 years "following
OL,18,Flegal advice".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34502
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1788794754
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAPause of councils change leaves
OL,4,Abill of 'millions'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government had previously given the
OL,7,Fgreen light to plans for the expansion
OL,8,Fof Plymouth, Torbay and Exeter, with
OL,9,Fthe rest of Devon forming a separate
OL,10,Fauthority.
OL,12,FThe Labour government had said it
OL,13,Fwanted to make local government simpler
OL,14,Fand more streamlined, but the plans
OL,15,Fwere heavily criticised by other
OL,16,Fparties who said they would damage
OL,17,Fservices while increasing costs to
OL,18,Ftaxpayers.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
